{t:"stack",id:"page",x:0,y:0,w:406,h:776,c:[{t:"stack",id:"worked_row",x:16.0,y:32.0,w:374.0,h:44.0,c:[{t:"stack",id:"worked_row_surface",x:16.0,y:32.0,w:374.0,h:44.0,c:[],variant:"surface",bg:4294835709,radius:10.0},{t:"button",id:"worked_row_control",x:16.0,y:32.0,w:374.0,h:44.0,enabled:1},{t:"text",id:"worked_row_label",text:"Worked for 3m 4s ›",x:26.53,y:41.5,w:178.0,h:24.0,size:18.7,line_height:22.63,weight:500,color:4281019180,variant:"single_line",alignx:0,font_src:"self:resources/ux/Inter-500.ttf",tracking:0.0}],kit:"{\"widget\": \"KitButton\", \"bindings\": {\"control\": [1], \"label\": [2]}}"},{t:"text",id:"answer_md",text:"Queued steers now survive a reconnect.\n\n• Fixed loss of queued steers when reconnecting after a drop in `steer_dropped` handling.\n\n• Updated `ui_protocol_transport.rs` to persist queued steers to the session ledger.\n\n• All tests pass: `12 passed`.\n\n• Changes included in commit `a6ea8505`.",x:27.0,y:106.0,w:356.0,h:492.0,size:17.5,line_height:38.0,weight:400,color:4280098079,bg:4294243573,alignx:0,variant:"markdown",font_src:"self:resources/ux/Inter-400.ttf"},{t:"svg",id:"icon_copy",x:24.0,y:662.0,w:20.0,h:20.0,src:"http://127.0.0.1:8170/ux-images/conversation-09/assets/icon_copy-e71cb744fd09.svg"},{t:"svg",id:"icon_thumbs",x:52.0,y:662.0,w:20.0,h:20.0,src:"http://127.0.0.1:8170/ux-images/conversation-09/assets/icon_thumbs-348cb6a4c084.svg"},{t:"svg",id:"icon_share",x:80.0,y:662.0,w:20.0,h:20.0,src:"http://127.0.0.1:8170/ux-images/conversation-09/assets/icon_share-b9aa1c6b91b9.svg"},{t:"text",id:"t11",text:"Sep 28, 9:41 PM",x:267.64,y:663.5,w:121.5,h:28.0,size:15.26,line_height:18.46,weight:400,color:4288848550,variant:"single_line",alignx:0,font_src:"self:resources/ux/Inter-400.ttf",tracking:0.0}],variant:"surface",bg:4294901502}
